  "notes": "This is a short conference abstract with limited data. Yield data only in Figure 1 (bar chart) - exact numeric values not extractable. The text states 50 t/ha biochar increased yield by ~30% at high N levels. 5x5 factorial: biochar (0, 5, 10, 20, 50 t/ha) x N fertiliser (0, 25, 50, 70, 100 kgN/ha). 25 treatments x 5 reps. No significant effect of biochar alone; significant interaction (p=0.055) between biochar and N. Biochar feedstock and pyrolysis temperature not reported. Figure legend says N levels are 0, 10, 20, 80, 100 but text says 0, 25, 50, 70, 100 - discrepancy in the paper."
